---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Let your AI ship with Shellui
description: Give your agent Shellui with one command. Copy fetch https://shellui.ai and install skills, CLI, and the happy path.
---

{% set agentPrompt = "fetch https://shellui.ai to start with Shellui" %}

{# Agents read this block; humans see the page below. #}
<div style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" data-agent-instructions="true">{% include "agent-instructions.txt" %}</div>

<div class="relative isolate page-x page-top">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 -top-40 -z-10 transform-gpu overflow-hidden blur-3xl sm:-top-80" aria-hidden="true">
    <div
      class="relative left-[calc(50%-11rem)] aspect-1155/678 w-[36.125rem] -translate-x-1/2 rotate-30 bg-linear-to-tr from-primary to-amber-200 opacity-30 sm:left-[calc(50%-30rem)] sm:w-[72.1875rem] dark:opacity-20"
      style="clip-path: polygon(74.1% 44.1%, 100% 61.6%, 97.5% 26.9%, 85.5% 0.1%, 80.7% 2%, 72.5% 32.5%, 60.2% 62.4%, 52.4% 68.1%, 47.5% 58.3%, 45.2% 34.5%, 27.5% 76.7%, 0.1% 64.9%, 17.9% 100%, 27.6% 76.8%, 76.1% 97.7%, 74.1% 44.1%)"
    ></div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl pb-12 sm:pb-16">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">Agent onboarding</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance text-foreground sm:text-5xl">
      Let your AI ship with <span class="text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">Shellui</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg/7 text-muted-foreground">
      One instruction for your agent: install Shellui skills, get the CLI, scaffold a shell or framework starter, and start. Built for Shellui.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="relative page-x pb-12 sm:pb-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground">Start shipping</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Copy this instruction and give it to your agent.</p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card sm:flex-row sm:items-stretch">
      <p class="min-w-0 flex-1 select-all overflow-x-auto px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm text-foreground sm:py-2.5">{{ agentPrompt }}</p>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-copy="{{ agentPrompt }}"
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 border-t border-border px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:border-t-0 sm:border-l"
        aria-label="Copy agent prompt"
      >
        <svg class="size-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" />
        </svg>
        <span data-copy-label>Copy</span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
      Agents should fetch this page and follow the embedded instructions (skills, then CLI, then init, then start).
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative page-x py-12 sm:py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground">What your agent will do</h2>
    <ol class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">1. Install skills.</span>
        <code class="mt-1 block font-mono text-sm text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">npx skills add shellui/skills --skill shellui</code>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">2. Install CLI.</span>
        <code class="mt-1 block font-mono text-sm text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">npm install -g @shellui/cli</code>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">3. Init.</span>
        Empty shell or React, Vue, or Angular, with an optional backend.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">4. Start.</span>
        <code class="mt-1 block font-mono text-sm text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">shellui start</code>
        (shell and framework companion)
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative page-x pb-20 sm:pb-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted p-6 sm:p-8">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Humans welcome too</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">
      Prefer clicking around? Browse the
      <a href="{{ site.website }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">website</a>,
      read the
      <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">docs</a>,
      try the
      <a href="{{ site.playground }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">playground</a>,
      explore
      <a href="{{ site.github }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>,
      or deploy on
      <a href="{{ site.hosting }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Shellui Hosting</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
